  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education for All Fast Track Initiative (EFAFTI) Catalytic Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;To help acceleration of progress towards Universal Primary Completion in countries with credible plans through a mixture of policy reform, increased resource mobilization (both domestic and external) and greater donor harmonization.  The key developmental objectives are
 
 Increase in universal primary completion rates in FTI countries
 Improved policies for education sector
 Increased donor harmonization
 Increased transparency and predictability of aid flows.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
